# 基本図形編集の道具パネルを、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの図形編集で同じに使う
# (design 11.3, 17.13), for tools/ui_run.py: a figure of one rectangle and two zigzag lines
# (mkbig fig 1 2 0) opened at 100,100 as 画用紙 is; its 道具パネル stands at the top of the
# screen (100,0), its buttons 32 square from 112,32 34 apart, the second row from 66 (the
# first row's middles at y 48, the second's at 82). The rectangle template taken and a
# rectangle drawn (it is then picked); 線色 with the red of its swatches, 塗りつぶし with
# pattern 20 of the fixed ones, 角丸 with 10 typed and Enter, 線種 with 5px, each put away
# with Escape: what is chosen goes on the picked rectangle. Saved, record 0 comes out the
# same, byte for byte. The palettes of the process stand where the desktop's do, framed
# and with no title, so its presses in them are the same.
# Keys: Esc 29, Backspace 2a, 1 1e, 0 27, Enter 28; Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 298 82
wait 300
drag 450 450 600 560
wait 400
click 162 48
wait 500
click 359 125
wait 300
shot tcmp_k_stroke
key 29
wait 300
click 128 48
wait 500
click 202 170
wait 300
shot tcmp_k_fill
key 29
wait 300
click 230 48
wait 500
key 2a
key 1e
key 27
key 28
wait 400
click 196 48
wait 500
click 509 95
wait 300
shot tcmp_k_lstyle
key 29
wait 300
sync 600
shot tcmp_k_done
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
logmark
click 298 82
expectsince figure: tool 7
drag 450 450 600 560
expectsince figure: drawn
logmark
click 162 48
expectsince figure: palette 1 open
wait 500
click 359 125
wait 300
shot tcmp_p_stroke
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 1 closed
logmark
click 128 48
expectsince figure: palette 0 open
wait 500
click 202 170
wait 300
shot tcmp_p_fill
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 0 closed
logmark
click 230 48
expectsince figure: palette 3 open
wait 300
key 2a
key 1e
key 27
key 28
expectsince figure: palette 3 closed
logmark
click 196 48
expectsince figure: palette 2 open
wait 500
click 509 95
wait 300
shot tcmp_p_lstyle
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 2 closed
wait 300
shot tcmp_p_done
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
